Everything in this repository made by zlelik, that is everything except the
third-party material listed further down, is the property of zlelik: the
background images in imgs/, the script in src/ that draws them, the prompts in
docs/, and the field config editor in tools/ with its own code and data.

It may be used only with FlexibleConnectedWatch, a watch face for Garmin
watches, and only in these ways:

  - the watch face, on any watch it is installed on, may download the images
    in imgs/ and draw them;
  - anyone may use the editor where zlelik publishes it,
    https://zlelik.github.io/FlexibleConnectedWatchArtifacts/field-config-editor.html,
    to write settings for the watch face, but not from a copy of it;
  - anyone may give the prompts in docs/, as they are or as the editor
    assembles them, to a language model to write settings for the watch face;
  - a setting written in any of these ways, such as a FieldsConfig value, may
    be used and shared as a setting of the watch face.

Any other use, and any copying, modification or distribution of this material
in whole or in part, needs the prior written permission of zlelik. Viewing and
forking the repository on GitHub, which GitHub's Terms of Service allow for
every public repository, gives no further right to use it.

