3. Data read from the Garmin Connect IQ SDK

So that its preview is laid out as a watch lays it out, the editor contains the
name, screen shape and screen size of each supported watch, and the size and
character widths of the fonts each one draws with, all read from the Garmin
Connect IQ SDK. No file of the SDK and no font is included. The SDK itself is
under the Garmin Connect IQ SDK License Agreement.


